{"id":"zdorovo","lemma":"здорово","pos":"adv","rank":254,"glosses":["great, very well, awesomely","very strongly, to a very great extent"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/57/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты выглядишь действительно здорово.","en":"You look really great.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to look","l":"выглядеть"},{"g":"really"},null]},{"text":"Твой план звучит здорово.","en":"Your plan sounds great.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"plan , scheme"},null,null]},{"text":"Я думаю, что это здорово.","en":"I think this is great.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"why"]]},{"text":"Ты уже здорово помог.","en":"You've been a great help already.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"already"},null,{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"}]},{"text":"Выглядит здорово.","en":"It looks great.","words":[{"g":"to look","l":"выглядеть"},null]}]}